//RS     /// D-TEST1 / #2502: generated property inputs are admitted only for the
//RS     /// same closed scalar/container family checked by sema. The emitter keeps
//RS     /// this mirror deliberately structural: MIR has already erased source
//RS     /// aliases, while unsupported nominal carriers remain an explicit E0613
//RS     /// unavailable case rather than reaching a `<T as JetGen>` compile error.
